  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be wonderful to have protection built into vrchat like the personal space bubble stopping any flashing and intense particles from showing to user making it more safe for world hoppers, clubbers, and just users entering a public instance from being flash bang by worlds",
